1
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:49,520
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:51,400
=Episode 15=

3
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,480
(Mortal Realm, Imperial Palace)

4
00:01:12,480 --> 00:01:17,200
(Queen Zhang, Huanxi Kingdom)

5
00:01:21,879 --> 00:01:23,159
The location of the Divine Stone

6
00:01:23,319 --> 00:01:24,400
has been found.

7
00:01:24,439 --> 00:01:26,040
You need only wait for good news.

8
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:36,599
I have consumed demons since childhood.

9
00:01:37,719 --> 00:01:39,680
I forged this body from their remains.

10
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:42,920
Normal arts can't kill me.

11
00:01:43,519 --> 00:01:45,280
The fact that she's the Stone...

12
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:48,319
I'll use the Xuanwu Sect's power

13
00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:50,879
to tell the whole world.

14
00:01:51,239 --> 00:01:52,599
You might stop me,

15
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:54,359
but

16
00:01:54,359 --> 00:01:56,400
can you stop the greed of the world?

17
00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:59,519
All of you

18
00:01:59,879 --> 00:02:01,239
will die.

19
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:14,319
Leave.

20
00:02:46,719 --> 00:02:49,560
All these years
of nurturing my strength...

21
00:02:50,639 --> 00:02:54,599
finally, the Stone appears.

22
00:02:58,159 --> 00:02:58,960
My great work

23
00:03:00,759 --> 00:03:01,680
is almost complete.

24
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:07,080
Hahaha!

25
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:12,400
Hahaha!

26
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:20,680
(Jichun Healing Hall)

27
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:21,840
There are two rooms.

28
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:22,800
One north, one south.

29
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:23,639
Completely separate.

30
00:03:23,719 --> 00:03:25,120
Pick whichever you like.

31
00:03:25,479 --> 00:03:26,319
- We shall share one room.
- We...

32
00:03:31,159 --> 00:03:33,479
So you two truly
are star‑crossed lovers.

33
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:36,599
No wonder you're stuck together
all the time.

34
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:39,960
Get some sleep, you two.

35
00:03:40,879 --> 00:03:43,840
Many patients are staying in this hall.

36
00:03:44,080 --> 00:03:45,199
They require proper rest.

37
00:03:45,199 --> 00:03:46,319
So try to keep it down.

38
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:47,800
As for you two...

39
00:03:56,759 --> 00:03:58,479
Lin Shuangyue,

40
00:03:58,479 --> 00:03:59,879
she is no ordinary person.

41
00:04:00,719 --> 00:04:03,360
She appeared in that morgue
out of nowhere

42
00:04:03,560 --> 00:04:05,199
and neither of us sensed a thing.

43
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:06,960
But she's not a demon either.

44
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:08,719
I have a feeling

45
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:11,520
she's not just in this

46
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,639
for the money.

47
00:04:15,039 --> 00:04:16,279
How can you be so sure?

48
00:04:18,639 --> 00:04:20,160
A demoness's instinct.

49
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:25,600
- Actually...
- Actually...

50
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:29,600
You go first.

51
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:32,160
There is something
I have been hiding from you.

52
00:04:33,839 --> 00:04:36,680
About the bite mark
and the Curse. At first...

53
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:37,480
I know.

54
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:39,720
I'm your cure.

55
00:04:39,879 --> 00:04:41,120
You wanted to eat me.

56
00:04:41,759 --> 00:04:42,720
How did you know?

57
00:04:43,319 --> 00:04:44,680
I've known from the very start.

58
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:46,480
Because of
the Thousand-Fold Love Ordeal.

59
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:49,759
The only way out is to kill me.

60
00:04:49,839 --> 00:04:50,639
Am I right?

61
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:52,879
How do you know that?

62
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:55,120
You pesky Taoist!

63
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,480
You want to kill your own wife?

64
00:04:56,959 --> 00:04:58,680
And you want to eat your own husband?

65
00:04:58,959 --> 00:04:59,759
Let go!

66
00:04:59,839 --> 00:05:00,639
You let go first.

67
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:02,199
If you let go, I will too.

68
00:05:02,759 --> 00:05:03,519
Fine.

69
00:05:03,519 --> 00:05:06,240
Hehehe, got you!

70
00:05:09,399 --> 00:05:10,839
Why are you looking at me like that?

71
00:05:10,959 --> 00:05:13,759
You're starting
to act more and more human.

72
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:15,759
You...

73
00:05:15,759 --> 00:05:17,120
Did you think I was inhumane before?

74
00:05:18,399 --> 00:05:19,519
No, I didn't.

75
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:27,800
Hearts linked.

76
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:30,240
No distance between us.

77
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:34,040
From now on,

78
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:37,519
this is our private spell.

79
00:05:37,759 --> 00:05:39,040
No matter when or where,

80
00:05:39,199 --> 00:05:41,800
we can reach each other
with just a thought.

81
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:44,759
This is fun.

82
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:45,079
Mm.

83
00:05:45,079 --> 00:05:46,480
So no matter where I go,

84
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:47,600
you'll always find me.

85
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:48,480
That is right.

86
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:50,279
I love this.

87
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:28,319
(Jiang Manor)

88
00:06:28,319 --> 00:06:29,040
Hey, you.

89
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:31,360
This porridge was made today.

90
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:32,720
Why are you throwing it away?

91
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:34,360
My mistress said,

92
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,639
what good is this porridge?

93
00:06:35,639 --> 00:06:36,959
The master is still dead.

94
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:38,759
She told me to dump it all.

95
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:41,040
Everyone in this house drank it.

96
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:44,279
That porridge
from your clinic. Doctor Lin's.

97
00:06:44,439 --> 00:06:45,240
Demon-warding porridge.

98
00:06:46,480 --> 00:06:47,400
(Jiang Manor)

99
00:06:47,400 --> 00:06:48,120
Understood.

100
00:06:56,839 --> 00:06:58,759
(Every manor
where a Bloodskin was found)

101
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:00,279
(was visited by Lin Shuangyue.)

102
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:07,639
(And every vicitim
who ended up as a Bloodskin)

103
00:07:08,639 --> 00:07:09,639
(was a government official.)

104
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:18,160
Ziyan,

105
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:19,120
are you there?

106
00:07:20,439 --> 00:07:21,399
Don't go back to the healing hall.

107
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:22,720
I am on my way back now.

108
00:07:22,879 --> 00:07:24,199
I've found the evidence.

109
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:24,920
The killer is...

110
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:25,720
Doctor Lin.

111
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:28,399
Hello there.

112
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:40,560
This porridge,

113
00:07:41,279 --> 00:07:42,639
it is just like people.

114
00:07:44,199 --> 00:07:45,360
Bad rice

115
00:07:46,519 --> 00:07:48,839
can never make good porridge.

116
00:07:49,519 --> 00:07:50,560
It was you, wasn't it?

117
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:03,199
Why did you kill all those people?

118
00:08:03,959 --> 00:08:05,519
Because they deserved death.

119
00:08:06,079 --> 00:08:07,279
Killing wasn't enough?

120
00:08:07,399 --> 00:08:08,879
What about the Bloodskin?

121
00:08:09,959 --> 00:08:10,759
Of course.

122
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:13,160
Death was not enough.

123
00:08:14,439 --> 00:08:16,360
They all wore masks of righteousness,

124
00:08:16,879 --> 00:08:18,279
pretending to be decent.

125
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:21,480
So I peeled that mask right off.

126
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:26,160
What do you think?

127
00:08:27,639 --> 00:08:29,480
My skill was not bad, was it?

128
00:08:29,759 --> 00:08:31,519
Every one of those animals

129
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:33,159
came off clean,

130
00:08:34,039 --> 00:08:36,000
not a single tear.

131
00:08:36,559 --> 00:08:38,240
You are sick. Truly sick.

132
00:08:40,559 --> 00:08:41,399
Sick?

133
00:08:43,399 --> 00:08:45,840
Compared to what they did to me,

134
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:49,320
the Bloodskin

135
00:08:50,759 --> 00:08:52,080
is nothing at all.

136
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:01,000
Look at mine.

137
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:02,480
Look at this one of mine.

138
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:04,000
It can fly!

139
00:09:04,639 --> 00:09:05,960
(It was a den of evil.)

140
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:08,399
(They were devils)

141
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:12,039
(feasting on)

142
00:09:12,039 --> 00:09:14,080
(innocent young girls.)

143
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:18,159
Look at this.

144
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:19,559
Mine is prettier.

145
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:23,360
Let me try.

146
00:09:24,279 --> 00:09:25,480
It is standing up!

147
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:28,639
So fun!

148
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:31,399
Look at my rattle drum!

149
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:34,240
Oh, wonderful!

150
00:09:35,559 --> 00:09:38,320
Any higher bids?

151
00:09:38,679 --> 00:09:39,480
Hahaha!

152
00:09:40,559 --> 00:09:41,960
Don't miss out!

153
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:48,000
Wow! Great, great, great!

154
00:09:48,639 --> 00:09:51,320
Any other nobles raising the price?

155
00:09:54,879 --> 00:09:56,200
Sold! No backing out.

156
00:09:56,639 --> 00:09:58,960
The girl's fate is sealed.

157
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:01,480
You may take your prizes

158
00:10:01,919 --> 00:10:03,519
and enjoy them.

159
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:17,039
Remember, wait until the fire dies down
before coming out.

160
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:19,799
I don't want to!

161
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:25,399
Listen to me.

162
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:28,240
This is your only chance to escape.

163
00:10:29,279 --> 00:10:31,679
You must see this world for me.

164
00:10:31,679 --> 00:10:32,480
Sister!

165
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:36,759
Promise me you'll live. For both of us.

166
00:10:37,639 --> 00:10:39,159
I won't!

167
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:42,080
Sister!

168
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:04,960
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

169
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:08,360
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

170
00:11:08,360 --> 00:11:11,880
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

171
00:11:11,880 --> 00:11:15,200
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

172
00:11:15,280 --> 00:11:22,120
♪Let the wind sweep away
this heavy air of sorrow♪

173
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:29,715
♪Do not forget the tangled paths
that you and I have crossed♪

174
00:11:30,240 --> 00:11:33,960
♪Let towering waves come crashing down;
I'll fight against the tide♪

175
00:11:33,960 --> 00:11:37,800
♪I shatter
the hollow fate they wrote for me♪

176
00:11:37,800 --> 00:11:44,600
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
